{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"> An original, turn-based place-taking game for a single player. Opponents use a simple deterministic local rule and can cut the exposed route. No online play, account, saving or network processing.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"territory-game UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"territory-game.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["territory-game.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Isang orihinal, turn-based na lugar-pagkuha ng laro para sa isang manlalaro. Opponents gamitin ang isang simpleng deterministic lokal na patakaran at maaaring i-cut ang exposed ruta. Walang online play, account, pag-save o network na pagpoproseso.","record_id":"e907cc70c29edfbec30d73545097372d0d587227fc70b903b0f8802ee9fa8bcb","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":0.7531054211249995,"source":"An original, turn-based area-capture game for one player. Opponents use a simple deterministic local rule and can cut the exposed route. There is no online play, account, saving or network processing.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"e3b621c7d3ef595834d60b6f37d52d5a0724bc798e72870467de608d57914b03","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Isang orihinal, turn-based na lugar-pagkuha ng laro para sa isang manlalaro. Opponents gamitin ang isang simpleng deterministic lokal na patakaran at maaaring i-cut ang exposed ruta. Walang online play, account, pag-save o network na pagpoproseso.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
